                                "text": "Socks dipt in Brandy-wine, and worn, are preventive."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2a71b7eb-3323-4094-b52d-c8d0e6d61b50",
                                "sense_id": "dbad32dd-edfe-3962-b00c-aaed47f5073e",
                                "text": "Running round the woodlump if you chance to find\nLittle barrels, roped and tarred, all full of brandy-wine,\nDon't you shout to come and look, nor use 'em for your play.\nPut the brishwood back again—and they'll be gone next day!"
                            }
